# NOT README.md -- pyproject.toml declares readme = "README.md", and
# `uv sync --frozen` (building the gnt-api package itself, not just
# syncing deps) fails with "failed to open file /app/README.md" if it's
# missing from the build context. Found via a real Railway build, not a
# guess -- excluding docs from the image seemed harmless until uv's own
# package-metadata step needed the file to exist at all.
